  m_text: "<size=120%><b>CR\xC9DITOS</b></size>\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>ORIENTA\xC7\xC3O</b></color></size>\nLeonardo
    Tortoro Pereira\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>DIRE\xC7\xC3O DE ARTE, UI/UX
    E DESENVOLVIMENTO</b></color></size>\nRyan Hideki Tadeo Guimar\xE3es\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>GAME
    DESIGN E PRODU\xC7\xC3O VISUAL</b></color></size>\nRafael Daiki Kaneko\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>PROGRAMA\xC7\xC3O
    E LIDERAN\xC7A T\xC9CNICA</b></color></size>\nAndr\xE9 Luis Dias Nogueira\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>ROTEIRIZA\xC7\xC3O
    E CONTE\xDADO T\xC9CNICO</b></color></size>\nFelipe Melchior de Britto\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>ASSETS
    DE SOM</b></color></size>\nhttps://freesound.org/people/Nomagician/sounds/833631/\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/jerry.berumen/sounds/762107/\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/TheSoundLibrary/sounds/842835/\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/thekindles/sounds/854151/\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/GloryToTheMachine/sounds/845154/\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/zagi2/sounds/273451/\r\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>ASSETS
    DE IMAGEM</b></color></size>\nhttps://www.magnific.com/free-vector/arcade-game-world-pixel-scene_4815143.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=6&uuid=d2e0a21d-d9a2-489d-b701-973be069edb8&track=ais_hybrid&query=8bit+wallpaper\n\n\n\n<size=90%><color=#FFD966><b>AGRADECIMENTOS
    ESPECIAIS</b></color></size>\n\xC0 UNESP e ao DEMAC\nAos amigos e familiares\nE
    a voc\xEA, que jogou at\xE9 o fim <3\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=200%><b>OBRIGADO
    POR JOGAR!</b></size>\n\n\n<size=80%><i>Feito com Unity e muita conscientiza\xE7\xE3o
    digital \u2615\U0001F512\n\n\nAt\xE9 um outro dia...</i></size>"
